DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, August 12th Patrick Budd w/ Jackson Perkins Patric
 k Budd is a Folk/Americana artist from Poolesville\, MD based out of Washi
 ngton\, DC. With personal\, powerful lyricism inspired by writers such as 
 Noah Kahan\, Zach Bryan\, and Tyler Childers\, Patrick weaves heartbreak a
 nd nostalgia into moments in time he wishes he could go back to. His debut
  album ‘Suburban Bench Swing’ is an open book about this very feeling\
 , and it is available to be streamed everywhere.
