DESCRIPTION:TimaLikesMusic\, DJ\, Producer\, Recording Artist\, Band Leade
 r\, and Filmmaker\, wants you to dance\, laugh\, sing\, and exorcise all o
 f the negative energy from your soul. And she wants you to do this by part
 ying\, Buga Suga style! Buga Suga features the best R&B music\, from Micha
 el to Bruno\, from Whitney to Mariah. DJ Tima\, backed by live drums\, wil
 l hit you hard with fierce joy. When she hops on timbales\, you’ll be be
 gging for more cowbell. Buga Suga is a legendary night that you’ll remem
 ber forever. Who is TimaLikesMusic? Check her out on TikTok or Instagram\,
  if you haven’t already\, and you’ll realize what a unique talent she 
 is. There’s something different about her\, something you like. Somethin
 g you love. Following on socials is one thing\, but experiencing her in re
 al life is another. Buy a ticket. Buy two. Bring a friend and Buga Suga al
 l night long!
