X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/nv5pq8-res-how-i-do-25-year-anniversary-live-night-1-28th-aug-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:RES - "How I Do" 25 Year Anniversary [LIVE] *Night 1*
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T230000
UID:2df4c3ac6547e4277d46203df4a35eb5@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Friday August 28th \\*Night 1\\* Celebrate the 25th Anniversar
 y of Res' classic album "How I Do" with Res live at Songbyrd! Res epitomiz
 es the archetype of an artist rebelling against the confines of traditiona
 l industry boxes\, effortlessly carving out a niche that is distinctively 
 her own. Her debut album\, How I Do\, has been immortalized as a cult clas
 sic\, while its successor\, the independently released Black Girls Rock\, 
 unveils Res as an artist exploring and expressing her authentic voice. The
  hit track from this release\, For Who You Are\, has remarkably amassed ov
 er 10 million YouTube streams. Penned by Res and co-produced with her late
  mentor\, Wah Wah Watson\, it echoes her indomitable spirit and drive. Her
  subsequent release\, Refried Mac\, is a heartfelt tribute to Fleetwood Ma
 c and has been met with equal acclaim. As a solo artist touring globally\,
  and as a backing vocalist for the legendary supergroup Gnarls Barkley dur
 ing their St. Elsewhere debut album tour\, Res has steadfastly cemented he
 rself as a dynamic force in both live performances and studio recordings.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/nv5pq8-res-how-i-do-25-year-anniversary-live-nig
 ht-1-28th-aug-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
