DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260829T230000
UID:96d8f9c744fcd7909e519fcdc78867dd@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Saturday August 29th \\*Night 2\\* Celebrate the 25th Annivers
 ary of Res' classic album "How I Do" with Res live at Songbyrd! Res epitom
 izes the archetype of an artist rebelling against the confines of traditio
 nal industry boxes\, effortlessly carving out a niche that is distinctivel
 y her own. Her debut album\, How I Do\, has been immortalized as a cult cl
 assic\, while its successor\, the independently released Black Girls Rock\
 , unveils Res as an artist exploring and expressing her authentic voice. T
 he hit track from this release\, For Who You Are\, has remarkably amassed 
 over 10 million YouTube streams. Penned by Res and co-produced with her la
 te mentor\, Wah Wah Watson\, it echoes her indomitable spirit and drive. H
 er subsequent release\, Refried Mac\, is a heartfelt tribute to Fleetwood 
 Mac and has been met with equal acclaim. As a solo artist touring globally
 \, and as a backing vocalist for the legendary supergroup Gnarls Barkley d
 uring their St. Elsewhere debut album tour\, Res has steadfastly cemented 
 herself as a dynamic force in both live performances and studio recordings
 .
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/mxg56w-res-how-i-do-25-year-anniversary-live-nig
 ht-2-29th-aug-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets
