BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/mxdw3w-cardinals-16th-sep-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Cardinals
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T230000
UID:70d40d69d4acc1b21c9000efc159792e@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:"With a scrappy DIY mantra at their heart\, Cardinals are the 
 next great band to emerge from Cork's burgeoning music scene. On their deb
 ut self-titled EP\, released via SoYoung\, the Cork group smash through th
 at notion entirely. There’s brooding intensity to be found\, but songs l
 ike ‘Unreal’ show a softer\, more melodic touch that shows they’re a
  far more kaleidoscopic proposition than that. One thing that does unite t
 hem with those bands\, however\, is that they are a product of Cork’s bu
 rgeoning DIY scene. “We put on shows in places where you wouldn’t ordi
 narily do that and we could capitalise on that\,” explains frontman Euan
  Manning. This scrappy mantra makes it into the EP’s sound\, however\, a
 nd perfectly captures the sound of Cardinals in the here and now." - Nick 
 Reilly\, Rolling Stone
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/mxdw3w-cardinals-16th-sep-songbyrd-washington-dc
 -tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
