X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/5368d8-starcleaner-reunion-tour-for-a-rainy-day-24th-sep-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Starcleaner Reunion: Tour for a Rainy Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T230000
UID:5ccf96bc8f3f145e53c365a2e16230c9@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Songbyrd x U+N Booking Present Thursday September 24th Vocalis
 t and tambourine player Jo Roman\, guitarists Pat Drummond and Neil Torman
 \, and bassist Adam Kenter grew up in the same small town of Springfield\,
  New Jersey. After meeting in high school\, they played together in variou
 s configurations\, bonding over a collective love for Brazilian psych\, C8
 6 jangle\, and ’90s noise. They chose the name Starcleaner Reunion after
  a 1970s children's book about magical beings that return light to the sky
 . They recorded their first EP\, 2023’s Club Estrella\, quickly\, with b
 arely a thought for production. There’s an innocence to these early\, ka
 leidoscopic bursts of alt-rock\, but also an instinctual familiarity. The 
 band approached their next EP\, 2024’s Café Life\, with the intention o
 f expanding the band’s universe. They performed live tirelessly after Ca
 fé Life\, fine-tuning their material along the way. As introduced through
  new single “Weather Instrument\,” new music from Starcleaner Reunion 
 is their most expansive and ambitious yet\, blending together poetic abstr
 action\, recombinant collage\, and sonic craftsmanship.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/5368d8-starcleaner-reunion-tour-for-a-rainy-day-
 24th-sep-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
