X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Spoonfed (EP Release Show)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260925T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260925T230000
UID:356f7b2053d93a24a2b5cb34331f1820@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Spoonfed is a Washington\, D.C.-based rock band consisting of 
 Will Sevy (vocals/guitar)\, Kevin Cox (bass)\, and Kieran O'Dell (vocals/d
 rums). Formed in 2021 in the basement of their house in Charlottesville\, 
 Virginia\, Spoonfed has grown from late-night jam sessions into one of the
  DMV's emerging indie bands. Spoonfed draws inspiration from the grunge ro
 ck of the 1990s\, the alt-rock of the early 2000s\, and the grooves of mod
 ern funk. Expect energy: dark and uplifting melodies\, dynamic rhythms\, m
 oody lyrics\, guitar solos. Their debut EP drops September 16.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
