X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/eo6vvw-jozzy-get-her-back-tour-28th-sep-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:JOZZY: GET HER BACK TOUR
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T230000
UID:5a20c6c19886b061f07a1db3f925fee0@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Before the world knew her name\, they knew her pen. Jozzy is t
 he Diamond certified\, three time Grammy nominated singer songwriter from 
 Memphis\, Tennessee\, whose catalog has generated over two billion streams
  across credits for Beyoncé\, SZA\, Summer Walker\, Lil Nas X\, Drake\, M
 etro Boomin\, Mary J. Blige\, and dozens more. She co wrote the Billy Ray 
 Cyrus verse that turned "Old Town Road" into the fastest Diamond certified
  song in RIAA history. She gave Beyoncé "Virgo's Groove." She penned Summ
 er Walker's "Body" and SZA's "Low." She scored Spider Man: Across the Spid
 er Verse. Raised in the lineage of Memphis soul royalty\, her mother sang 
 alongside Al Green and Ann Peebles at Hi Records. Jozzy honed her craft un
 der the mentorship of Timbaland and Missy Elliott before becoming one of t
 he most commercially impactful writers of her generation. As a solo artist
 \, she defies genre at every turn. Her collaboration with Fred again..\, "
 ten\," has surpassed 181 million streams and charted in the UK Top 15\, wh
 ile her scene stealing feature on A$AP Rocky's Don't Be Dumb alongside Tyl
 er\, the Creator further cemented her as an artist operating at the highes
 t level\, surpassing 3.4 million monthly listeners. Her debut studio album
 \, Soundtrack 2 Get Her Back\, released via BMG\, has been embraced by fan
 s and critics alike\, marking a defining moment in her evolution from one 
 of music's most accomplished songwriters to one of its most exciting emerg
 ing artists.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/eo6vvw-jozzy-get-her-back-tour-28th-sep-songbyrd
 -washington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
