X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Ali
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T230000
UID:585032b60991df5e79801da8057c6a63@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Ali is a three-piece musical project originating from Jakarta 
 Indonesia. Initiated by Arswandaru and John Paul Patton\, the desire of Al
 i is to incorporate Middle Eastern culture with elements 70’s Indonesian
  psychedelic funk\, cinematic soul\, afro beat\, and disco to create a new
  groove and sound to the contemporary and vibrant Indonesian music scene. 
 With all lyrics written in Arabic\, Ali builds on the influence of Middle 
 Eastern art and music\, which over centuries has assimilated itself deep i
 nto Indonesian culture and way of life. Also as the cultural heritage of A
 rswandaru as an Indonesian – Arab mixed to implement the Arabic lyrics. 
 John Paul (Drums) and Arswandaru (Bass/Vocals) are joined by Absar Lebeh o
 n guitar to complete the trio. They are bringing their self described ‘M
 iddle Easten Beats with South East Twists’ to Indonesia and the world. A
 li promises to deliver a diverse and unique experience to the Indonesian m
 usic and festival scenes.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/8elwyv-ali-30th-sep-songbyrd-washington-dc-ticke
 ts
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
